      <title>OpenART用一万个演化场景给AI智能体做红队测试</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260824/OpenART%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%AA%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E7%BB%99AI%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E5%81%9A%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/</link>
